== Walkthrough ==

You'll need to talk to [[Jinkus Felligan]], the Shaman Guildmaster, inside the Temple of the Tribunal (/loc 315, 444). 

You say, 'Hail, Jinkus Felligan' 

: Jinkus Felligan says, 'Welcome! Welcome to the Church o' the Tribunal! Do ye require healing or are ye [new to the Shamans o' Justice], then, eh?'

You say, 'new to the Shamans o' Justice'

: Jinkus Felligan says, 'Then I welcome ye into our noble order. Ye'll serve us well or spend an eternity in the dungeons o' the Tribunal. Are ye ready to [contribute to yer church] or do ye [wish to meditate] within our walls?'

You say, 'contribute to yer church'

: Jinkus Felligan says, 'Ye'll help all o' Halas by doing the bidding o' this church. Go to Holana. Tell her [Jinkus sent] ye to assist her. She'll have work fer ye. Perhaps, if ye're planning on passing near Qeynos, ye can [make a delivery] as well?'

Next, go find [[Holana Oleary]] in Ye Majik shop on the east side of [[Halas]] inside Yee Majik (/loc 134, -336). 

You say, 'Jinkus sent me' 

: Holana Oleary says, 'So, ye're the next to be tested, then, eh?!  I pray ye're able to return. Ye'll need to take this note to Einhorst in Clan McMannus' fishing village in the Plains o' Karana. He'll hand ye the monthly Karana clover shipment to be returned to me. Just remember, dinnae stop running! Do ye [need directions to Clan McMannus]?'

'''You receive [[A Tattered Note]] (''Item Lore : Message to Clan McMannus'')

You say, 'need directions to Clan McMannus'

: Holana Oleary says, 'Ye go through Everfrost Peaks and run through Blackburrow. Once in Qeynos Hills, ye'll head to yer left and follow the pathway to the Plains of Karana. In the plains, when the pathway splits, go to yer right. Then just head toward the horizon.'

==== Traveling to the Western Karana fishing village ====
To get to the village, head south out of [[Halas]], all the way to the southwest corner of [[Everfrost Peaks]], through [[Blackburrow]], to [[Qeynos Hills]]. Then follow the eastern mountains south, until you hit a path which leads to the [[Western Karana]] zone line. In [[Western Karana]], follow the path until it opens up from the zone valley, then turn right to head south. You'll find the fishing village straight ahead, just before the shore. [[Einhorst McMannus|Einhorst]] is in one of the small fishing huts (/loc -3807, -2096). 

Hand over the note to [[Einhorst McMannus]].

: Einhorst McMannus says, 'Yes. We almost forgot of the shipment of Karana clovers. Here you are, my friend. Back to the north with you. I am sure the Shamans of Justice will need this.'

