==== Side Quest Opportunity ====
Before you hurry back to Halas, you may want to do the [[Lion Meat Shipment Quest]] with [[Einhorst McMannus|Einhorst]] as well.

Head back to [[Halas]] and hand over the [[Karana Clover Shipment]] to [[Holana Oleary]].

: Holana Oleary says, 'Good work. We Shamans o' Justice are like no other. We must remain in top physical form for we never know when justice must be served. I was commanded to give ye a reward. Take this. It was doing nothing more than collecting dust. Go, and serve justice well.'

